---
---

<div
  class="demo-rise grid grid-cols-1 min-[560px]:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_200px] drop-shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(19,28,36,0.10)]"
  aria-label="Example: a support ticket with Sidecar's analysis panel attached"
>
  <div class="ticket rounded-t-md border border-line bg-surface p-5 text-[0.82rem] min-[560px]:rounded-l-md min-[560px]:rounded-tr-none">
    <div class="mb-3 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 border-b border-line pb-3">
      <span class="font-mono text-[0.72rem] text-muted">TICKET #4821 · VPN</span>
      <span class="pill-open rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.06em] whitespace-nowrap"
        >Open · P2</span
      >
    </div>
    <h3 class="mb-2.5 font-display text-[0.95rem] font-semibold">Users can't reach the file server since this morning</h3>
    <p class="mb-3 text-muted">
      "About 15 people in the Kraków office lost access around 8:40. VPN connects fine but shares time out. Nothing changed on
      our side…"
    </p>
    <div
      class="ticket-log overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre rounded bg-code px-3 py-2.5 font-mono text-[0.68rem] leading-[1.7] text-muted"
    ><b>08:41:02</b> vpn-gw01  tunnel established, phase2 OK
<b>08:41:37</b> fs-01     SMB session setup <b>NT_STATUS_IO_TIMEOUT</b>
<b>08:42:10</b> fw-core   policy #218 <b>DROP</b> 10.4.0.0/16 → fs-01:445</div>
  </div>

  <aside class="sidecar-panel flex flex-col gap-3.5 rounded-b-md p-4 text-[0.76rem] min-[560px]:rounded-r-md min-[560px]:rounded-bl-none">
    <span class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent">◆ Sidecar</span>
    <div class="panel-block">
      <h4 class="mb-1 font-mono text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] opacity-55">Summary</h4>
      <p class="leading-normal">
        Firewall rule #218 is dropping SMB (445) from the VPN subnet to fs-01. Started 08:42 — likely last night's policy push.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-block">
      <h4 class="mb-1 font-mono text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] opacity-55">Similar incident</h4>
      <p class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-ok">#3907 · resolved · 94% match</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-block">
      <h4 class="mb-1 font-mono text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] opacity-55">Suggested action</h4>
      <p class="panel-action rounded px-2 py-1.5 font-mono text-[0.68rem] opacity-85">→ Draft reply · Create Jira ticket</p>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>

<style>
  .pill-open {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--warn) 15%, transparent);
    color: var(--warn);
  }
  .ticket-log b {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sidecar-panel {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--accent);
  }
  @media (min-width: 560px) {
    .sidecar-panel {
      border-top: none;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .sidecar-panel {
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--ink);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-top: 4px solid var(--accent);
    }
    @media (min-width: 560px) {
      .sidecar-panel {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      }
    }
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .sidecar-panel {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    border: none;
    border-top: 4px solid var(--accent);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .sidecar-panel {
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--accent);
  }
  @media (min-width: 560px) {
    :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .sidecar-panel {
      border-top: none;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    }
    :global(:root[data-theme='dark']) .sidecar-panel {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    }
  }
  .panel-action {
    border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 35%, transparent);
  }
</style>
